{"id":"en_rejected-but-chosen-the-true-alpha-s-mark","title":"Rejected but Chosen: The True Alpha's Mark","titleEn":"Rejected but Chosen: The True Alpha's Mark","description":"Tristan, an arrogant heir, brings about a conflict beyond his control when he rejects Vesella, the mate fate chose for him. She goes on to become the fearless Alpha of Silver Crest, overcoming those who stand against her. Her strength draws Kaelen, Tristan's honorable brother, who proves to be her genuine second-chance mate. Together they navigate love, treachery, and lingering conspiracies, eventually forming a new family—only for their adopted son, Leo, to be taken by their foes. Those wanting to follow this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/rejected-but-chosen-the-true-alphas-mark/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/rejected-but-chosen-the-true-alphas-mark/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Female","Plot Twist","Regret","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_rejected-but-chosen-the-true-alpha-s-mark_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rejected-but-chosen-the-true-alpha-s-mark_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rejected-but-chosen-the-true-alpha-s-mark_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rejected-but-